Description: OpenMediaVault Agent Station & Remote Coding Stack
 A 24/7 self-hosted AI development & remote coding stack for OpenMediaVault.
 Provides an OpenMediaVault WebGUI management interface for:
  - LiteLLM Multi-Provider AI Gateway (Gemini 3.7, Claude 3.7 Sonnet, Copilot)
  - Syncthing bi-directional Obsidian Second Brain sync
  - Telegram, Signal & Discord Remote Control Coding Bots
  - Browser-based Web Terminal
